------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Changes made in this derivative (relative to the original sm_overview):
  - Reworked the export for Scrap Mechanic 0.6.6+ (sm.json.save was sandboxed):
    the cell data is now written to the game log and rebuilt into cells.json.
  - Version-safe in-place patcher for the game scripts (patch_game.py) instead
    of copying pre-patched files.
  - Automatic tile imagery sourced and flattened from the game's own tile files
    (build_tiles.py), covering tiles the original had no screenshots for.
  - Guided one-shot installer (setup.ps1) and automatic JSON embedding.

Scrap Mechanic is property of Axolot Games AB. This project has no affiliation
with Axolot Games.
